WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,260 --> 00:00:03,260
Did you bring something delicious to the fish?

2
00:00:03,260 --> 00:00:09,460
If you can eat it, then you can eat it.

3
00:00:09,460 --> 00:00:11,460
Have you delivered the twenty-spice beer that your boss asked for?

4
00:00:11,460 --> 00:00:12,460
Yeah, I sent it to you in the afternoon.

5
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:14,460
The boss also gave me a thousand yuan as hard work fee.

6
00:00:14,460 --> 00:00:16,460
I didn't want it, but it was forced on me.

7
00:00:16,460 --> 00:00:17,460
If someone gives it to you, just take it.

8
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:20,460
To them, thousands of dollars is no different than a few dollars.

9
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:40,840
No one is interested in shareholders
